<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/1843c318-c446-4727-b7c8-caefc0f90507> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-11-03T16:26:37.704201"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
