<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/2e1b2286-dda0-41be-aaca-2efcd80da2ed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/2e1b2286-dda0-41be-aaca-2efcd80da2ed> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Freebase15KSelected".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/2e1b2286-dda0-41be-aaca-2efcd80da2ed> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Dataset derived from FB15K and ClueWeb.\nThe dataset FB15KSelected was constructed by first limiting the set of relations in FB15K to the most frequently used 401 relations.".
