<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/887d3d03-1cda-456b-9180-9d84299e5577> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains a set of relations among nations and their features. \nThere are 14 nations, 56 relations and 111 features, for a total of 12,530 ground atoms, of which 2565 are true.".
