<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/8e72f81b-d016-4c7f-ae74-b5795d218dea> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/8e72f81b-d016-4c7f-ae74-b5795d218dea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "DB100K".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/8e72f81b-d016-4c7f-ae74-b5795d218dea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Created from the mapping-based objects of core DBpedia.\nThe DB100K data set consists of 470 relations and 99,604 entities among them. The training set contains 597,572 triples, the validation set 50,000 triples, and the test set 50,000 triples. 99 soft rules are created for DB100K.\n\nAll triples are unique and we make sure that all entities/relations appearing in the validation or test sets were occurring in the training set.".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/8e72f81b-d016-4c7f-ae74-b5795d218dea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "8e72f81b-d016-4c7f-ae74-b5795d218dea".
