<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/71326556-b657-4f3c-a88f-b1d7185ae337> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/71326556-b657-4f3c-a88f-b1d7185ae337> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Amazon product data".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/71326556-b657-4f3c-a88f-b1d7185ae337> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains product reviews and metadata from Amazon, including 142.8 million reviews spanning May 1996 - July 2014.\n\nThis dataset includes reviews (ratings, text, helpfulness votes), product metadata (descriptions, category information, price, brand, and image features), and links (also viewed/also bought graphs).".
