<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/9118f44b-6d9a-4247-ad6c-a476981291db> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-31T14:58:31.277542"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
