<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/ef97bc02-12e8-4bab-85f5-edd540440de0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset is built by forming links between images sharing common metadata from Flickr. Edges are formed between images from the same location, submitted to the same gallery, group, or set, images sharing common tags, images taken by friends, etc. The original images are collected from PASCAL, ImageCLEF, MIR, and NUS-wide.".
