<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/0be26f02-db06-4e57-bf19-01d774c7c42e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-30T17:29:44.985451"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
