<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/f43f7f83-61e3-444f-8a28-f17bd9f4d78a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-29T18:21:28.336534"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/f43f7f83-61e3-444f-8a28-f17bd9f4d78a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://fedTool4boxology.org/Organization/leibniz-universitat-hannover>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/f43f7f83-61e3-444f-8a28-f17bd9f4d78a> <http://purl.org/spar/datacite/isDescribedBy> <https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/D18-1360>.
