<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/f43f7f83-61e3-444f-8a28-f17bd9f4d78a> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#distribution> <https://research.tib.eu/ldm/e896ef7b-e38c-44c7-a391-dbc0cfa8aa12>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/f43f7f83-61e3-444f-8a28-f17bd9f4d78a> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#distribution> <https://research.tib.eu/ldm/34d1fa55-93cd-4e50-8da2-cd8808cec474>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/e14d3987-6338-4e7b-87d1-3d9782dbf9f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/e14d3987-6338-4e7b-87d1-3d9782dbf9f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "YAGO37".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/e14d3987-6338-4e7b-87d1-3d9782dbf9f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "YAGO37 is extracted from the core facts of YAGO3, contaning 37 relations and 123,189 entities. The training set contains 989,132 triples, the validation set 50,000 triples, and the test set 50,000 triples. 16 rules are created for YAGO37.".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/e14d3987-6338-4e7b-87d1-3d9782dbf9f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "e14d3987-6338-4e7b-87d1-3d9782dbf9f2".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/e14d3987-6338-4e7b-87d1-3d9782dbf9f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-10-29T16:38:24.819360"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
