<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/e14d3987-6338-4e7b-87d1-3d9782dbf9f2> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#distribution> <https://research.tib.eu/ldm/9a477d2f-8686-4b1a-8a2c-3e89cc13748a>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/97c10ab3-618a-448e-b2cd-f30939595345> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/97c10ab3-618a-448e-b2cd-f30939595345> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Kinship".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/97c10ab3-618a-448e-b2cd-f30939595345> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ethnographic data describing the Alyawarra-speaking Aboriginal people of central Austraila collected from 1971-1972 by Woodrow Denham. This is the source data for the Kinships Dataset commonly used in knowledge graph completion benchmarks.".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/97c10ab3-618a-448e-b2cd-f30939595345> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "97c10ab3-618a-448e-b2cd-f30939595345".
