<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/2068f7c9-dcd4-4df4-94e6-383b0c323639> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "HetMat archive, which provides a directory and file-naming structure for storing hetnets on disk tailored towards matrix operations.\nThe HetMat format contains directories for nodes and edges, and includes a metagraph.json file in the root directory. metagraph.json uses the JSON format available from this repository".
