<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/dec840b3-d36e-4513-9daa-dd724b9c1693> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "hetionet-v1.0.db.tar.bz2 is a bzip2-compressed tarball of a Neo4j database. The database has been migrated to the Neo4j 3.0.1 Community Edition.\nhetionet-v1.0-neo4j.dump is a neo4j database dump created with neo4j-admin dump.".
