<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/65de417f-c380-4b79-bded-063ce9c6b78a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The tabular format requires two tables to represent a hetnet. It also does not include node and edge properties such as the license or attribution and therefore we recommend using our JSON or Neo4j format instead.\nhetionet-v1.0-nodes.tsv is a table of network nodes.\nhetionet-v1.0-edges.sif.gz is a gzipped TSV table of network edges.".
