<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/96d61fb9-e417-42c1-9030-0bd3044d2325> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Consists of a set of images associated with each of the entities in the DBpedia15k knowledge graph.\nFor now, we provide a list of URLs that can be downloaded with a script which also scales the images (thanks to https://github.com/jrieke). We also provide the links of the Freebase IDs to their image URLs. \nIf you want to obtain the embeddings learned from a trained VGG16, you can download them (https://www.dropbox.com/s/rfl27sqpet7wyb3/DB15K_ImageData.h5?dl=0). For example, the embedding for the DB15k entity http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bright_Star_(film), indexed by the identifier DBIMG00039, can be accessed:\n\nimport h5py\nimport numpy as np\nfilename = \\'DB15K_ImageData.h5\\'\nf = h5py.File(filename, \\'r\\')\nvgg_feats = f[\\'DBIMG00039\\']".
