<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/a6dfa748-0378-47db-a0d9-05ece4c290f9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "CODEX-M (k = 10), which has 206k triples. CODEX-M is all-purpose, being comparable in size to FB15K-237 (§ 2.1), one of the most popular benchmarks for KGC evaluation.".
