<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/2bebab10-ee06-47a9-a51c-c52d43a9583f> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://ldm23.service.tib.eu/ldmservice/dataset/9118f44b-6d9a-4247-ad6c-a476981291db/resource/2bebab10-ee06-47a9-a51c-c52d43a9583f/download/types.zip>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/2bebab10-ee06-47a9-a51c-c52d43a9583f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The file entity2types.json maps each Wikidata entity ID to a list of Wikidata type IDs, i.e.,\n\n{\n  \\'<Wikidata entity ID>\\':[\n    <Wikidata type ID 1>,\n    <Wikidata type ID 2>,\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n\n\nEach subdirectory contains a types.json file formatted as follows:\n\n{\n  <Wikidata type ID>:{\n    \\'label\\':<label in respective language if available>,\n    \\'description\\':<Wikidata description in respective language if available>,\n    \\'wiki\\':<Wikipedia page URL in respective language if available>\n  }\n}\n\nEach extracts.zip file contains zipped files of entity descriptions from Wikipedia. Each file is named <Wikidata entity ID>.txt.".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/2bebab10-ee06-47a9-a51c-c52d43a9583f> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "7059990"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
