<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/29a443b8-7a49-4b20-84ab-85036f08b42e> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://ldm23.service.tib.eu/ldmservice/dataset/9118f44b-6d9a-4247-ad6c-a476981291db/resource/29a443b8-7a49-4b20-84ab-85036f08b42e/download/relations.zip>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/29a443b8-7a49-4b20-84ab-85036f08b42e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We provide relation labels and Wikidata descriptions for relations in six languages: Arabic (ar), German (de), English (en), Spanish (es), Russian (ru), and Chineze (zh).\n\nEach subdirectory contains a relations.json file formatted as follows:\n\n{\n  <Wikidata relation ID>:{\n    \\'label\\':<label in respective language if available>,\n    \\'description\\':<Wikidata description in respective language if available>\n  }\n}".
