<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/a83dd4cd-071f-46cd-bbfd-7c7c7fc83816> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://ldm23.service.tib.eu/ldmservice/dataset/9118f44b-6d9a-4247-ad6c-a476981291db/resource/a83dd4cd-071f-46cd-bbfd-7c7c7fc83816/download/entities.zip>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/a83dd4cd-071f-46cd-bbfd-7c7c7fc83816> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We provide entity labels, Wikidata descriptions, and Wikipedia page extracts for entities and entity types in six languages: Arabic (ar), German (de), English (en), Spanish (es), Russian (ru), and Chineze (zh).\n\nEach subdirectory contains an entities.json file formatted as follows:\n\n{\n  <Wikidata entity ID>:{\n    \\'label\\':<label in respective language if available>,\n    \\'description\\':<Wikidata description in respective language if available>,\n    \\'wiki\\':<Wikipedia page URL in respective language if available>\n  }\n}\n\nFor the labels, descriptions, or Wikipedia URLs that are not available in a given language, the value will be the empty string.".
