<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/0fdc38b8-53ca-4bf0-b3d3-94d722ea61d5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-10-30T18:16:49.033495"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/0fdc38b8-53ca-4bf0-b3d3-94d722ea61d5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language> "English".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/0fdc38b8-53ca-4bf0-b3d3-94d722ea61d5> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#mediaType> "Text".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/0fdc38b8-53ca-4bf0-b3d3-94d722ea61d5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-30T18:26:06.183630"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
