<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/91a4cf56-2c95-4fd8-8b88-b6e0ec78c2e3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ADE-NEG.txt provides all sentences in the ADE corpus that DO NOT contain any drug-related adverse effects.\nThe format of ADE-NEG.txt is as follows:\nPubMed-ID\\sNEG\\sSentence\nWhere \\'NEG\\' is a fixed string".
