<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/31ea7e15-72c7-47bb-838a-f1bfec55320d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "DRUG-AE.rel".
<https://research.tib.eu/ldm/31ea7e15-72c7-47bb-838a-f1bfec55320d> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://ldm23.service.tib.eu/ldmservice/dataset/4b224094-6c2e-4500-8762-ac803a48a45c/resource/31ea7e15-72c7-47bb-838a-f1bfec55320d/download/drug-ae.rel>.
